Hey everyone,

We'll be running a containers devroom at FOSDEM 2018 in Brussels, Belgium.
This edition will be during the weekend of the 3rd and 4th of February.

We're looking for anything container related, regardless of operating
systems and ranging from low level kernel work all the way to high level
management tools. Talk length should be one of 10, 20 or 40 minutes.

The submission deadline is November 30th with notifications going out
by December 11th.


More details on the devroom can be found here:
  https://discuss.linuxcontainers.org/t/fosdem-containers-devroom-call-for-=
papers/622

Submissions should be sent through:
  https://penta.fosdem.org/submission/FOSDEM18


Should you have any question, you can reach the devroom organizers through:
  containers-devroom-manager-8Ycg9RsmSNMdnm+yROfE0A@public.gmane.org


Looking forward to seeing you all in Brussels!

St=E9phane


PS: Please forward this message to any relevant project mailing-lists.

